---
title: DeskFlow — Authentication Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as Auth Controller
    participant Auth as AuthService
    participant JWT as JwtTokenProvider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as Redis

    %% Registration
    Note over Client,Cache: Registration
    Client->>API: POST /auth/register {email, password, name}
    API->>Auth: register(request)
    Auth->>DB: save User (BCrypt password)
    Auth-->>Client: 201 Created {userId}

    %% Login
    Note over Client,Cache: Login
    Client->>API: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    API->>Auth: login(request)
    Auth->>DB: findByEmail(email)
    Auth->>Auth: verify BCrypt password
    Auth->>JWT: generateAccessToken(user) → 15 min
    Auth->>JWT: generateRefreshToken(user) → 7 days
    Auth->>Cache: SET refresh:{userId} = tokenHash (TTL 7d)
    Auth-->>Client: 200 OK {accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn}

    %% Authenticated Request
    Note over Client,Cache: Authenticated Request
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/tickets (Bearer accessToken)
    API->>JWT: validateToken(accessToken)
    JWT->>Cache: GET blacklist:{jti} → check revoked
    JWT-->>API: valid → SecurityContext populated
    API-->>Client: 200 OK {tickets}

    %% Token Refresh
    Note over Client,Cache: Token Refresh
    Client->>API: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
    API->>Auth: refresh(refreshToken)
    Auth->>JWT: extractUserId(refreshToken)
    Auth->>Cache: GET refresh:{userId} → compare hash
    Auth->>JWT: generateAccessToken(user) → new 15 min
    Auth-->>Client: 200 OK {accessToken, expiresIn}

    %% Logout
    Note over Client,Cache: Logout
    Client->>API: POST /auth/logout (Bearer accessToken)
    API->>Auth: logout(userId, jti)
    Auth->>Cache: DEL refresh:{userId}
    Auth->>Cache: SET blacklist:{jti} (TTL = token remaining life)
    Auth-->>Client: 204 No Content